{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;MOMO Bunny's Super Chat Strike!!&quot; \ud83d\udc30\ud83d\udcb8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The legendary mercenary MOMO Bunny was enjoying retirement until a Colonel suddenly appeared:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc68\u200d\u2708\ufe0f &quot;Help! My team's been captured!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc30 &quot;Sure... but let me livestream it!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And thus begins a rescue mission with a twist - every saved teammate becomes a Super Chat donor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4b FIGHTING GAME STYLE SPECIAL MOVES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Pull off flashy moves with command inputs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc65 TEAM UP WITH RESCUES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Use rescued allies for special moves</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- But don't overuse them - they might leave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udcb0 SUPER CHAT IS LIFE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Rescued allies send Super Chats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Collect enough to enter Super Tension Mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udd85 BEWARE OF AERIAL PREDATORS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Dodge bird attacks while entertaining viewers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Chat might warn: &quot;They're after those thighs!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfa5 REALISTIC STREAM CHAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Live comments affect your performance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- &quot;Nice move!&quot; &quot;What were you thinking!?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique action game where Super Chats fuel your fight! Can you become the legendary mercenary streamer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;No Super Chat? Then it's CHARGE TIME!!&quot; \ud83d\udd25</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516930?t=1741753034","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516930?t=1741753034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516930/80c195893fafbd9526a38bf46a8fb3fdb062703c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741753034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516930/80c195893fafbd9526a38bf46a8fb3fdb062703c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741753034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;MOMO Bunny's Super Chat Strike!!&quot; \ud83d\udc30\ud83d\udcb8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The legendary mercenary MOMO Bunny was enjoying retirement until a Colonel suddenly appeared:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc68\u200d\u2708\ufe0f &quot;Help! My team's been captured!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc30 &quot;Sure... but let me livestream it!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And thus begins a rescue mission with a twist - every saved teammate becomes a Super Chat donor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd4b FIGHTING GAME STYLE SPECIAL MOVES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Pull off flashy moves with command inputs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc65 TEAM UP WITH RESCUES</strong></p><